    - target: {fileID: 5305849131204444020, guid: 09189932f1af056498cf80e33d7431f0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "project Tepa: A sleek pair of augmented-reality glasses that lets the
        wearer glimpse into the past of whatever they\u2019re looking at. By focusing
        on an object or location, the lenses overlay a visual reconstruction of its
        earlier state\u2014revealing how it once appeared, who interacted with it,
        or events that took place there. The visions are time-bound and fade after
        a few moments, offering only brief but vivid windows into history.\n\n(press
        F to use Ability)"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
