    - target: {fileID: 5305849131204444020, guid: 09189932f1af056498cf80e33d7431f0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "project chrono :compact, time-altering device  that allows users to
        temporarily swap any present-day object with its exact past version from
        a chosen moment in time. Once activated, the device reconstructs the item
        as it existed before\u2014restoring its original condition, form, and properties.
        However, this change is fleeting: after 24 hours, the past version vanishes,
        and the original present-day item reappears as it was before the swap."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
